description	"Sith Assassin

2-life Utility Focused Stealth Sith with customizable Force Powers and Lightsaber attributes.

^2Weaponry: 
- Melee
- Short Light Saber
-- Saber With Shoto (Duals/Cyan/Purple)
-- Single Saber (Red/Yellow/Blue)
-- Saber Throw ^3[CS1]
-- Saber Deflect (2)
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- Saber Defense (1)

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Force Focus (2)
- Force Block (1)
- Force Sense (3)
- Anti Mind Trick (1)
- Knockdown Roll
- Dexterity (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- Force Blind (1)
- Force Jump (1)
- Force Sight Immunity
- Security Specialist (15% Faster Hack Speed)"